WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:01.580
Matthew 4

00:01.580 --> 00:07.980
Then Jesus was led up by the Spirit into the wilderness to be tempted by the devil.

00:08.640 --> 00:12.980
And after fasting forty days and forty nights, he was hungry.

00:13.660 --> 00:16.260
And the tempter came and said to him,

00:17.740 --> 00:27.380
If you are the Son of God, command these stones to become loaves of bread.

00:27.380 --> 00:29.220
But he answered,

00:30.100 --> 00:36.000
It is written, Man shall not live by bread alone, but by every word that comes from the mouth of God.

00:36.760 --> 00:42.620
Then the devil took him to the holy city and set him on the pinnacle of the temple and said to him,

00:43.720 --> 00:52.700
If you are the Son of God, throw yourself down, for it is written,

00:53.340 --> 00:56.980
He will command his angels,

00:57.380 --> 00:59.120
concerning you,

01:00.220 --> 01:05.200
and on their hands they will bear you up,

01:05.760 --> 01:10.780
lest you strike your foot against a stone.

01:11.420 --> 01:13.240
Jesus said to him,

01:14.060 --> 01:18.600
Again it is written, You shall not put the Lord your God to the test.

01:19.380 --> 01:26.320
Again the devil took him to a very high mountain and showed him all the kingdoms of the world and their glory.

01:26.600 --> 01:27.360
And he said to him,

01:27.380 --> 01:28.520
And he said to him,

01:29.440 --> 01:39.440
All these I will give you, if you will fall down and worship me.

01:40.540 --> 01:42.840
Then Jesus said to him,

01:43.700 --> 01:46.340
Be gone, Satan, for it is written,

01:46.920 --> 01:50.840
You shall worship the Lord your God, and him only shall you serve.

01:51.520 --> 01:56.820
Then the devil left him, and behold, angels came and were ministering to him.

01:57.380 --> 02:01.280
Now when he heard that John had been arrested, he withdrew into Galilee.

02:01.680 --> 02:05.340
And leaving Nazareth, he went and lived in Capernaum by the sea,

02:05.600 --> 02:07.760
in the territory of Zebulun and Naphtali,

02:08.080 --> 02:11.800
so that what was spoken by the prophet Isaiah might be fulfilled.

02:12.320 --> 02:15.440
The land of Zebulun and the land of Naphtali,

02:15.980 --> 02:18.280
the way of the sea, beyond the Jordan,

02:19.080 --> 02:20.480
Galilee of the Gentiles,

02:20.940 --> 02:23.920
the people dwelling in darkness have seen a great light,

02:23.920 --> 02:27.360
and for those dwelling in the region and shadow of death,

02:27.940 --> 02:30.360
on them a light has dawned.

02:31.160 --> 02:33.980
From that time Jesus began to preach, saying,

02:34.800 --> 02:38.160
Repent, for the kingdom of heaven is at hand.

02:39.880 --> 02:43.080
While walking by the sea of Galilee, he saw two brothers,

02:43.540 --> 02:44.800
Simon, who was called Peter,

02:45.120 --> 02:48.620
and Andrew his brother, casting a net into the sea, for they were fishermen.

02:49.120 --> 02:50.060
And he said to them,

02:50.700 --> 02:53.500
Follow me, and I will make you fishers of men.

02:54.320 --> 02:56.780
Immediately they left their nets and followed him,

02:56.780 --> 02:59.680
and going on from there he saw two other brothers,

03:00.000 --> 03:02.600
James the son of Zebedee and John his brother,

03:02.880 --> 03:04.680
in the boat with Zebedee their father,

03:05.140 --> 03:05.900
mending their nets.

03:06.220 --> 03:07.180
And he called them.

03:07.760 --> 03:11.620
Immediately they left the boat and their father and followed him.

03:13.440 --> 03:15.520
And he went throughout all Galilee,

03:15.680 --> 03:18.760
teaching in their synagogues and proclaiming the gospel of the kingdom

03:18.760 --> 03:22.400
and healing every disease and every affliction among the people.

03:22.880 --> 03:25.040
So his fame spread throughout all Syria,

03:25.040 --> 03:26.760
and they brought him all to Syria,

03:26.780 --> 03:28.780
and he healed those who were sick,

03:28.780 --> 03:30.780
those afflicted with various diseases and pains,

03:30.780 --> 03:32.780
those oppressed by demons, epileptics and paralytics,

03:32.780 --> 03:34.780
and he healed them.

03:34.780 --> 03:38.780
And great crowds followed him from Galilee and the Decapolis,

03:38.780 --> 03:40.780
and from Jerusalem and Judea,

03:40.780 --> 03:42.780
and from beyond the Jordan.

